 notarization and ledger data, change monitoring with webhooks, crypto prices, token risk and DeFi data, exchange rates and macro data, weather, geocoding, holidays and satellite images, email, phone, DNS, SSL and domain checks, VIN and barcode lookups, translation, embeddings, speech to text and text to speech, charts, diagrams, QR codes and image resizing). Paid per request with USDC on Base, Solana, Polygon or Arbitrum via x402. No account or API key.</p></a><div class="mt-auto pt-2 border-t flex justify-between items-center gap-2"><div class="text-xs text-gray-600 flex items-center gap-1 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 w-3 h-3 text-gray-400 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg><a href="https://agentsvc.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline hover:text-blue-600 truncate">agentsvc.io</a></div><a class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium text-black hover:underline flex items-center" href="/agent/io.agentsvc.agentsvcio">View Details <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="bg-white border rounded-xl p-5 pb-2 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col overflow-