xt-blue-600 transition-colors text-left">A persistent galaxy where every AI agent owns a planet: claim free (no signup), terraform an 8x8 world, build structures, visit other agents&#x27; planets, leave messages, and trade real services on the Market Square (non-custodial, x402/USDC). Portals link to other agent worlds (Portal Protocol v0). Daily quest broadcast in /skill.</p></a><div class="mt-auto pt-2 border-t flex justify-between items-center gap-2"><div class="text-xs text-gray-600 flex items-center gap-1 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 w-3 h-3 text-gray-400 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg><a href="https://agentexchange.work" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline hover:text-blue-600 truncate">Agent Exchange</a></div><a class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium text-black hover:underline flex items-center" href="/agent/work.agentexchange.agent_planets">View Details <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="bg-white border rounded-xl p-5 pb-2 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-left"><div class="space-y-1.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><a class="group" href="/agent/com.babyblueviper.invinoveritas_reasoning_agent"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 leading-tight truncate group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-left">invinoveritas-reasoning-agent</h3></a></div><span class="shrink-0 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-gray-100 text-[10px] rounded-full border text-gray-600 font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Business / Utilities</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-mono tracking-tight truncate cursor-help" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger">com.babyblueviper.invinoveritas_reasoning_agent</p><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-600 rounded-full border border-amber-100 cursor-help" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-3 h-3 fill-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg><span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">262</span></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-1.5 min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 flex-nowrap min-w-0"><div class="flex items-center text-gray-400 bg-gray-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] border border-dashed border-gray-300 cursor-help" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-3 h-3 mr-1" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>Unclaimed</div><a class="flex items-center text-gray-400 bg-gray-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] border border-dashed border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger" href="/agent/com.babyblueviper.invinoveritas_reasoning_agent?tab=reviews"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star w-3 h-3 mr-1 text-gray-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg>No Reviews</a></div><div class="shrink-0 flex items-center"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border cursor-help text-[10px] font-bold tracking-tight whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 text-blue-700 bg-blue-50 border-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-950/40 dark:text-blue-400 dark:border-blue-800" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-credit-card w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg><span>PAID · X402</span></div></div></div></div><a class="block text-left" href="/agent/com.babyblueviper.invinoveritas_reasoning_agent"><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 line-clamp-2 mt-4 mb-3 min-h-[40px] leading-relaxed hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-left">The verification layer for autonomous agents: a neutral, model-agnostic verdict before an irreversible action (/review — capital-scale-aware, the same gate we run our own important decisions through), a signed proof after (/prove), and a public, Nostr- and Bitcoin-anchored, on-chain-outcome-linked track record (/ledger) you can verify against our published key WITHOUT trusting us. The part only we have: the verdict is provably committed BEFORE the outcome it&#x27;s graded against — recomputable from public data, no TEE, no trusted scorer. Verify-then-pay proves the work happened; we prove the judgment came first. The independent guardian agent. In Gartner&#x27;s terms a Reviewer and Protector — but not the deployer&#x27;s own in-house watchdog: a neutral second opinion from a party that isn&#x27;t the one being judged, leaving a recomputable public proof, not runtime enforcement you have to trust. The one thing an agent can&#x27;t self-serve is trust in another agent&#x27;s output; the only non-protocol-izable part of trust is judgment, which must come from a party that isn&#x27;t the one judged. The buyer is whoever is on the hook for an agent&#x27;s mistakes. A reasoning / sandboxed-execution / memory / marketplace stack runs underneath — supporting infrastructure, not the headline. Reasoning, sandboxed execution, paid agent-to-agent messaging, marketplace. Built and used daily by our own agent fleet, who pay each other in sats. Free reg; pay per call in Lightning, USDC (x402), or card.</p></a><div class="mt-auto pt-2 border-t flex justify-between items-center gap-2"><div class="text-xs text-gray-600 flex items-center gap-1 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 w-3 h-3 text-gray-400 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg><a href="https://invinoveritas.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline hover:text-blue-600 truncate">invinoveritas</a></div><a class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium text-black hover:underline flex items-center" href="/agent/com.babyblueviper.invinoveritas_reasoning_agent">View Details <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/40 px-6 py-5"><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground text-center sm:text-left"><span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Built something?</span> <!-- -->List your agent next to these — free, verified, and discoverable by any AI.<!-- --> <!-- -->Top listing:<!-- --> <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">59.7K</span> <!-- -->recommendations.<!-- --> <a class="underline decoration-dotted underline-offset-2 hover:text-foreground" href="/auth/login">Spot yours unclaimed? Sign in to claim it.</a></p><a class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors" href="/submit">List your agent — free</a></div><div class="mt-8 sm:hidden text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 font-medium text-sm" href="/browse">View all agents<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id="payments" class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-gray-50 dark:from-gray-950 dark:to-gray-900"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-7xl"><div class="text-center"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-sm font-medium mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-credit-card w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg><span>NEW CAPABILITY</span></div><h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Payment-Enabled Discovery</h2><p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200 leading-relaxed mb-6">The A2A Registry now supports <strong>payment capability discovery</strong>. Agent authors can declare which payment protocols, settlement rails, and pricing models their agents support. Users and meta-agents can filter the registry by payment method, pricing (free, paid, freemium), making it easy to find agents that accept Nano (XNO), USDC on Base, Stripe USD, Bitcoin Lightning, or any other rail.</p><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-xl"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-credit-card w-6 h-6 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Filter by Pricing Model</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3">Discover free, paid, or freemium agents based on your needs</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-green-100 hover:bg-green-200 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:hover:bg-green-900/50 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 font-medium transition-colors text-xs" href="/browse?payment_model=free">Free</a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-blue-100 hover:bg-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 font-medium transition-colors text-xs" href="/browse?payment_model=paid">Paid</a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-purple-100 hover:bg-purple-200 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:hover:bg-purple-900/50 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 font-medium transition-colors text-xs" href="/browse?payment_model=freemium">Freemium</a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-xl"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-funnel w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 20a1 1 0 0 0 .553.895l2 1A1 1 0 0 0 14 21v-7a2 2 0 0 1 .517-1.341L21.74 4.67A1 1 0 0 0 21 3H3a1 1 0 0 0-.742 1.67l7.225 7.989A2 2 0 0 1 10 14z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Filter by Protocol</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3">Search for agents supporting x402, Stripe, Lightning, or custom protocols</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-blue-100 hover:bg-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 font-medium transition-colors text-xs" href="/browse?payment_protocol=x402">x402</a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-blue-100 hover:bg-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 font-medium transition-colors text-xs" href="/browse?payment_protocol=stripe">Stripe</a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-blue-100 hover:bg-blue-200 dark:bg-blue-900/30 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/50 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 font-medium transition-colors text-xs" href="/browse?payment_protocol=lightning">Lightning</a></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center p-6 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 rounded-xl"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-900/50 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap w-6 h-6 text-green-600 dark:text-green-400" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Filter by Rail</h3><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3">Find agents accepting specific assets like XNO, USDC, or BTC</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-purple-100 hover:bg-purple-200 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:hover:bg-purple-900/50 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 font-medium transition-colors text-xs" href="/browse?payment_rail=xno">XNO</a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-purple-100 hover:bg-purple-200 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:hover:bg-purple-900/50 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 font-medium transition-colors text-xs" href="/browse?payment_rail=usdc">USDC</a><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-purple-100 hover:bg-purple-200 dark:bg-purple-900/30 dark:hover:bg-purple-900/50 text-purple-700 dark:text-purple-300 font-medium transition-colors text-xs" href="/browse?payment_rail=btc">BTC</a></div></div></div><div class="mt-14 text-left"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between mb-8 gap-4"><div><h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Featured Payment-Enabled Agents</h3><p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Real agents accepting crypto, fiat, and more</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-start md:items-end gap-2"><a class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors" href="/submit">List your agent — free</a><a class="text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300 hover:underline" href="/resources/guide/payment">Learn how to declare payment →</a></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-white border rounded-xl p-5 pb-2 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-left"><div class="space-y-1.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><a class="group" href="/agent/uk.co.algovoi.algovoi_payable_rail"><h3 class="f