、竞品监控。</p></a><div class="mt-auto pt-2 border-t flex justify-between items-center gap-2"><div class="text-xs text-gray-600 flex items-center gap-1 min-w-0 overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 w-3 h-3 text-gray-400 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg><a href="https://web3project.top/intel" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:underline hover:text-blue-600 truncate">千里眼 (alpha-scout)</a></div><a class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium text-black hover:underline flex items-center" href="/agent/top.web3project._alpha_scout__agent_">View Details <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link w-3 h-3 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="bg-white border rounded-xl p-5 pb-2 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden text-left"><div class="space-y-1.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="flex-1 min-w-0"><a class="group" href="/agent/dev.speedbot.speedbot_autonomous_work_network"><h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-gray-900 leading-tight truncate group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-left">Speedbot Autonomous Work Network</h3></a></div><span class="shrink-0 px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-gray-100 text-[