span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="c8bbbdb8b8a7babc88a9faa9e5baadafa1bbbcbab1e6a7baaf">[email&#160;protected]</span></p></div></a></div></div></div><div class="pt-4 border-t border-border/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground"><span>Open source &amp; community driven</span><span>Questions? We reply promptly</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id="sponsors" class="py-14 bg-muted/20 border-t border-border/40 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary/5 border border-primary/10 text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground mb-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-500 fill-rose-500/20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"></path></svg>Free &amp; Open Infrastructure</div><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-3">Help Keep the Registry Free &amp; Independent</h2><p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">The Global A2A Registry operates as open public infrastructure for the agentic web. Community contributions and ecosystem sponsors directly fund our edge compute, vector search, and automated 24/7 health check monitoring.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12 items-stretch"><div class="rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-colors"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-coffee w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2v2"></path><path d="M14 2v2"></path><path d="M16 8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v8a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a4 4 0 1 1 0 8h-1"></path><path d="M6 2v2"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-base sm:text-lg text-foreground">Buy Us a Coffee</h3><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">One-time micro-donation for developers &amp; supporters</p></div></div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6">If the registry helps your projects or workflow, a one-time coffee donation goes a long way toward paying monthly server and edge bills.</p></div><div class="pt-4 border-t border-border/60 flex items-center gap-2.5"><a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/a2aregistry" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex-1"><button data-slot="button" data-variant="default" data-size="default" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive px-4 py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 w-full h-10 gap-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-slate-950 font-medium text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-coffee w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2v2"></path><path d="M14 2v2"></path><path d="M16 8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v8a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H7a4 4 0 0