?\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card hover:border-border transition-colors overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base text-foreground hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors [\u0026::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-left\",\"children\":\"How is this different from AWS, Google, or Microsoft agent registries?\"}],[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"qrunsl\",{\"d\":\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-5 pb-5 pt-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed border-t border-border/50 pt-4 mt-[-1px]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Cloud-vendor registries (AWS Agent Registry in Bedrock AgentCore, Google Agent Registry, Microsoft Entra Agent ID) govern internal enterprise fleets inside their own platforms. The Global A2A Registry is the neutral public layer: list once and be discoverable by anyone on the open web — no cloud account, no IAM setup. Many organizations use both side by side. (Facts last checked August 2026.)\",\" \",false]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"How much does it cost to list an agent?\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card hover:border-border transition-colors overflow-hidden\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 cursor-pointer font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base text-foregro